    "text": "2news.com\nwebsite\nReno\nCity of Reno approves additional funding for the Geiger Grade Horse Fencing Project\nBy Jessica McClain,\n1 hours agoThe Reno City Council approved a specific wild horse fencing project near Geiger Grade on October 8, which is the mountain road (Nevada state route 341) connecting Reno to Virginia City, Nevada. The project is aimed at installing and improving fencing along Geiger Grade and in parts of South Reno...\n1",
